# Version 1.3.0 (versionCode 14) — update, not a first release

<en-US>
• Portfolio with profit/loss and trip budgets
• Hidden-cost check for exchange offers and a Quick Settings tile
• History: where today's rate stands, SMA 50/200, CSV export
• Alerts with percent change, quiet hours and history; voice input
• Past-date conversion, saved pairs, morning digest, top movers, cross rates
• Gold by purity, widget trends, backup and restore
• Anonymous usage statistics are now optional (off by default)
</en-US>

